@startuml
title Hannibal Protocol SPEC-001 v0.5 — Evidence provenance and action gate
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Windows 11" as OS
component "Authenticated Sentry Collector" as S
database "Append-only Event Journal" as J
component "Trusted Ingestion Verifier" as V
database "Evidence Roots / Derivation DAG" as P
component "Threat Detection" as D
component "Graph Analysis" as G
component "Tactical ML" as M
component "Overwatch Safety Policy" as O
component "Containment Broker\n(revalidates source and target)" as B
OS --> S: Observed raw event
S --> J: canonical identity, raw ID
J --> V: trusted event envelope
V --> P: verification + root IDs
P --> D: evidence
P --> G: derived graph hypotheses
P --> M: anomaly rankings
D --> O: finding + explicit roots
G --> O: context ONLY, not corroboration
M --> O: triage ONLY, not corroboration
O --> B: scoped, signed-action request\nonly if evidence independent
B --> OS: verified local-only containment
B --> J: immutable action receipt
note bottom of O
Missing telemetry, uncertain lineage, stale facts,
bad signatures or protected targets => ALERT/DENY
end note
@enduml
